== Attacks and abilities ==
{{For|strategies for defeating Oozers|Aggressive creature strategies#Oozer}}

=== Area of effect ===
Oozers will stretch slightly before compressing and releasing a cloud of poisonous gas 8 meters in radius, applying the [[Poison]] status (115 [[Damage types#Poison|Poison]] damage). Despite visual appearances, the cloud does not actually persist and only hits once. This ability can be used when a player is within 3 meters, and it has a cooldown of 4 seconds.

